<title>LIECHTENSTEIN: SOCCER-MACEDONIA BEAT LIECHTENSTEIN 11-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-MACEDONIA BEAT LIECHTENSTEIN 11-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>ESCHHEN, Liechtenstein 1996-11-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Macedonia beat</p>
<p>Liechtenstein 11-1 (halftime 6-0) in their World Cup European</p>
<p>group eight qualifier on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Liechtenstein - Franz Schaedler (79)</p>
<p>Macedonia - Dejvi Gavevski (8, 13, 60), Georgi Hristov (23),</p>
<p>Mitko Stojkovski (38, 44), Toni Micevski (45, 49), Sasa Ciric</p>
<p>(54, 88 penalty), Vanco Micevski (90)</p>
<p>Attendance: 2,600</p>
<p>Group 8 standings (tabulate under - played, won, drawn,</p>
<p>lost, goals for, goals against, points):</p>
<p>Group eight</p>
<p> Macedonia	    4   2   1   1  15   5   7</p>
<p> Ireland		2   2   0   0   8   0   6</p>
<p> Romania		2   2   0   0   7   0   6</p>
<p> Lithuania	    3   2   0   1   4   4   6</p>
<p> Iceland		3   0   1   2   1   7   1</p>
<p> Liechtenstein	4   0   0   4   2  21   0</p>
<p>Next match: November 10, Ireland v Iceland.</p>
</text>
